@startuml
left to right direction
rectangle "Concept\noverview, website" as concept
rectangle "Model template\nmodel (LinkML)" as model
rectangle "Runtime packages\nbe-core, ts-core" as packages
rectangle "Service templates\nproxy, keycloak, be, ui,\nschema, type, unit,\nct, ts, ts-api, wf, lab" as templates
rectangle "Tools\ntools-pentest, tools-sbom,\ntools-linkml-graph" as tools
rectangle "Installation tool\nmeta (ifdd-meta)" as installation
rectangle "Instances\n(own repositories of an installation)" as instances
concept ..> templates : describes
model --> templates : contexts, vocabularies\nand units for schema, type, unit
packages --> templates : runtime of be and ts-api
templates --> instances : cruft create, cruft update
model --> instances : cruft create, cruft update
tools ..> instances : can check and document
installation ..> instances : can create, run and test
@enduml
